<title>USA: Boston Acoustics CEO Francis Reed dies.</title>
<headline>Boston Acoustics CEO Francis Reed dies.</headline>
<dateline>PEABODY, Mass. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Acoustics Inc said Monday that Francis Reed, its co-founder, chief executive and chairman, died Saturday.</p>
<p>Reed, 63, founded the company in 1979 with company President Andrew Kotsatos.  </p>
<p>Kotsatos has assumed all of Reed's duties, company Vice President of Finance Debra Richer-Rosato said.</p>
<p>Richer-Rosato said the company did not know the cause of death.</p>
